<title>SWEDEN: TENNIS-SWEDEN AND SOUTH AFRICA LEVEL 2-2 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SWEDEN AND SOUTH AFRICA LEVEL 2-2 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>VAXJO, SWEDEN 1997-04-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden and South Africa were level at 2-2 after the first reverse singles in their Davis Cup World Group second round tie on Sunday.</p>
<p>Result:</p>
<p>Wayne Ferreira (South Africa) beat Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) 6-4 6-4 6-4</p>
</text>
